Subject: Share original frontend instance setters and loading-scene setup prefix

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Share actual attribute/visibility/string/resource setter effects with checked
native snapshots. Share BaseLoadingScene's authored component setup while keeping
the original HBMManager call in the console caller and explicit as the remaining
native boundary. No manager readiness, global defaults or menu services selected.

Refreshed for decomp 9046e67a: the frontend instance sources, tlInstance.inl,
tlImageInstance.h and SHLoading.cpp keep their upstream text (the series' later
restore patches made these edits net zero); this patch only adds the shared
steps header.

